<title>USA: ATLAS AIR INC. NAMES HASSANEIN SENIOR VP.</title>
<headline>ATLAS AIR INC. NAMES HASSANEIN SENIOR VP.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlas Air Inc named Ms. Nesa Hassanein Senior Vice President and General Counsel, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Effective August 18, Hassanein will report directly to Atlas' president Mickey Foret at the company's Golden, Colorado corporate headquarters. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
